essbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>DOI KAZUHIDE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FURUNO MASAHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MASUDA TSUGUNORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AOKI, HIDEO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DOI, KAZUHIDE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FURUNO, MASAHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MASUDA, TSUGUNORI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Plasma generating mean (21) generates a hydrogen-containing plasma under a low pressure in a vacuum chamber (12) while being supplied with a process gas from a gas supplying means (31). A soft solder alloy on an object (11) to be processed and held by object exposing means (15) is exposed to the hydrogen-containing plasma. Simultaneously with the exposure or after the exposure, the soft solder alloy is reflowed in a vacuum by heating means (36). Thus, using the inexpensive soft solder alloy on the object (11), a bump-shaped electrode terminal having an excellent reliability is formed without a cleaning step because no flux is used.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un générateur de plasma (21) produit un plasma hydrogéné à basse pression dans une chambre à vide (12) tout en étant alimenté d'un gaz de traitement provenant d'un distributeur de gaz (31). Un alliage d'apport de brasage tendre sur un objet (11) à traiter reposant sur un porte-objet (15) est exposé au plasma hydrogéné. En même temps ou après l'exposition, l'alliage d'apport de brasage tendre subit une refusion sous vide sous l'effet d'une source chaude (36). Ainsi, en utilisant de l'alliage d'apport de brasage tendre bon marché sur l'objet (11), on arrive à réaliser une borne d'électrode en bosse présentant une bonne fiabilité, et ce, sans nettoyage du fait qu'on n'utilise aucun flux.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>